# Provisioning Virtual Machines on Virtuozzo Private Cloud

## Project Overview

As part of a production infrastructure deployment, I provisioned multiple virtual machines on the **Virtuozzo Private Cloud** platform for 
application, database, monitoring, backup, and reporting workloads.

The deployment involved creating virtual machines, allocating compute resources, configuring networking, attaching storage volumes, installing 
Red Hat Enterprise Linux, and preparing the servers for application deployment.

